  "description": "Debug-only developer tools for Rask apps on ASP.NET Core and .NET WebAssembly. Referencing it attaches the tools to both hosts in a Debug build with no code in the app, and a Release publish carries none of it: the build strips the assembly and its deps.json entry, then fails if either remains. The in-page panel shows every frame the page and the app exchange, and the component tree with each component's props.",
